        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你已学完了整条路径。如今，真正的旅程——一段毕生的旅程——才开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've learned the WILD dreamer's superpower: staying perfectly, gently calm." : {
      "localizations" : {
