            "value" : "你已学会弯折梦的地理。整片梦境，皆任你遨游。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've learned to read the threshold's signs. The doorway has a shape now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
