    "You've learned to turn up the dream's resolution. Reality has competition now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تعلّمت أن ترفع دقّة الحلم. للواقع منافس الآن."
